# Postbus 150: the Reisebus's machine (D-070, D-097) in the Austrian
# Postbus look. Yellow Y/o/O body, a dark d window band with thin m
# pillars, a blank w destination panel above the windscreen (no digits, no
# logos: the sign boards carry the text), k/d bumper, two k/d wheels with i
# hubs, hazard lamps O off / w on, R tail lamps. Faces LEFT, no mirror.
# The roof line is flat over the whole length (the roof bounce covers it).
# idle = door open, engine running (1 px body shake, exhaust puff i/w).
# telegraph = door closed, hazard lamps blink. drive = hubs turn, 1 px bounce.
# halt = stopped at its halt, doors shut, faces E (noses c) and hands c
# pressed to the windows; frame 1 the passenger in the 4th window shrugs.
# Derived from reisebus.sprite with a scratch remap script, frozen here.
sprite = postbus
size   = 64x32
origin = 32,32
hitbox = 2,4,60,28
anim   = idle      frames=2 ticks=30 loop
anim   = telegraph frames=2 ticks=6 loop
anim   = drive     frames=2 ticks=4 loop
anim   = halt      frames=2 ticks=16 loop
